# C++ Performance

Consult these topics when writing performance-critical C++:

- Vector reserve (avoid repeated reallocations on growth).
- Small string optimization.
- Avoid `std::list` / `std::map` where a contiguous container or `unordered_map` fits better.
- PCL (Point Cloud Library) optimization.
- Cache-friendly iteration order.
